# Keep the build context small and free of secrets. Only Go sources,
# generated API code and embedded migrations are needed to build services.

# Hidden files and directories: VCS data, .env files, editor and tool
# state. None of them are needed to compile the services.
.*

# Secrets: never send them to the daemon
secrets
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.crt

# Build and test artifacts
bin
*.exe
coverage.out
coverage.html
cover_*.out
fuzzcache

# Not needed to compile the services
tests
web/test
**/*_test.go
**/testdata
docs
deployments
scripts
*.md
Dockerfile
